# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets and server state — NEVER commit these.
# Mod configs hold the CheeseDash master token, Stripe API keys and webhooks.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored `config/` would also
# ignore Java packages named `config` (several mods have one), silently dropping
# source files from the commit.
/config/
*/config/*.json
*/run/
run/
world/
logs/
*.log
**/cheesedash.json
**/cheesedash_audit.json
**/cheesestore*.json
*.env
.env*
secrets*
*.pem
*.key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gradle / Java build output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
out/
bin/
.gradle/
gradle-app.setting
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
*.class
*.jar
!**/gradle/wrapper/*.jar

# Loom / Fabric
.fabric/
remappedSrc/
*-dev.jar
*-sources.jar

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Third-party jars used as compile-time dependencies.
# These belong to their respective authors and must NEVER be redistributed
# here. Contributors supply their own copies — see localdeps/README.md.
# (Already covered by `*.jar` above; kept explicit so the intent survives edits.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
localdeps/*.jar
dist/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
.settings/
.classpath
.project
.metadata
*.launch

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Working files that must not reach the public repo
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
temp/
tmp/
.planning/
*.bak
*.orig
*~
